      "en": "Suppose the target arm angle is 20 degrees"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3-2",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "spoken": "방금 전 팔은 오십 도였다면,",
      "ko": "방금 전 팔은 오십 도였다면,",
      "en": "but the previous angle was 50."
    },
    {
      "id": "p3-3",
      "lineIndex": 2,
